NotoSansSC-VF.ttf is the unmodified Simplified Chinese variable-font subset
published by Adobe and Google in https://github.com/notofonts/noto-cjk.

Penglai 0.5.6 bundles the complete upstream SC font instead of a fixture-only
glyph subset, so arbitrary Simplified Chinese text is available offline.

